### RBAC  (core/rbac/api/routes.ts) — every route needs a role permission
###       read:role · manage:role · assign:role  (admin wildcard *:* covers all)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Log in — dev@auric.local already has the admin role (see http/README.md)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dev@auric.local", "password": "correct horse battery staple" }

